    "tools": "SharpSCCM (get secrets / local secrets), SCCMHunter, PXEThief, MalSCCM, sccmwtf/pysccm, CMLoot, Impacket/DonPAPI(DPAPI復号), PowerShell + WMI/CIM(Get-WmiObject root\\ccm\\policy)",
