        "plat": "Event Search",
        "t": "ローグな LDAP/SMB リスナー、Netlogon リレー、Certighost 系 PoC、証明書ベース PKINIT ツールの実行。正規の AD CS 管理ツールは除く",
        "q": "event_simpleName=ProcessRollup2 (CommandLine=\"*certipy*\" OR CommandLine=\"*certighost*\" OR CommandLine=\"*gettgtpkinit*\" OR (CommandLine=\"*rubeus*\" AND CommandLine=\"*asktgt*\" AND CommandLine=\"*certificate*\") OR (CommandLine=\"*ntlmrelayx*\") OR (CommandLine=\"*python*\" AND CommandLine=\"*ldap*\" AND (CommandLine=\"*server*\" OR CommandLine=\"*listen*\")))\n| stats count values(CommandLine) as cmd by ComputerName, UserName, FileName\n| sort - count"
