        "q": "DeviceFileEvents\n| where Timestamp > ago(30d)\n| where InitiatingProcessFileName =~ \"w3wp.exe\"\n| where ActionType == \"FileCreated\"\n| where FileName endswith \".aspx\" or FileName endswith \".ashx\"\n| where FolderPath has_any (\"LAYOUTS\", \"Web Server Extensions\")\n| extend SuspiciousName = FileName has_any (\"spinstall\", \"shell\", \"cmd\")\n| project Timestamp, DeviceName, FileName, FolderPath, SuspiciousName, InitiatingProcessAccountName, InitiatingProcessCommandLine\n| order by SuspiciousName desc, Timestamp desc"
