        "q": "// W3CIISLog または カスタム取り込みテーブル(例: SharePoint_IIS_CL)を想定\nSharePoint_IIS_CL\n| where TimeGenerated > ago(30d)\n| where csUriStem_s has \"/_layouts/15/ToolPane.aspx\"\n| where cIP_s !in (\"既知の管理端末IPリスト\")\n| summarize Requests=count(), Methods=make_set(csMethod_s) by cIP_s, bin(TimeGenerated, 5m)\n| where Requests > 3\n| sort by Requests desc"
